Subdirectories in this folder contain test cases for set-start-line under various machine configurations:

test cases:
* lathe
* mill

Subroutines (test config uses top-level directory as subroutine path):
* log_modal_state.ngc - subroutine to capture a bunch of interp state
* open_startline_logfile.ngc - subroutine to open a named logfile

Common code (symlink this into each test directory):
* checkresult - common check function to compare two log files and highlight any differences (empty log files are an error)
* main_test_runner - top-level test runner
* set-start-line-ui.py - main script to run linuxcnc instance and execute tests

